## Terms I am still learning
- commit - saving a snapshot of your changes in Git with a short note describing what changed
- push - sending your committed changes from your computer up to GitHub
- pull - bringing changes from GitHub down to your computer
- merge - combining changes from two different branches into one

## What confused me
- How commit, push, merge, and pull work together

